DC = Difficulty Class (Target Number)

<DICE>1d20+5:Strength:DC15</DICE> Modifier +5 ✅
<DICE>1d20+3:Dexterity:DC12:ADV</DICE> Advantage (Roll twice, take higher) 🍀
<DICE>1d20-1:Wisdom:DC14:DIS</DICE> Disadvantage (Roll twice, take lower) ⚠️
{{/unless}}{{unless::{{littleDevilNot::{{eq::{{littleDevilCalc::{{var::trpgmode}}=1}}::1}}}}}}
